  "releaseNotes": "RequestModel:\n      - Added full support for flexible custom HTTP requests.\n      - Introduced overloads allowing any method, URL, body, and content-type.\n      - Enabled advanced scenarios such as overriding GET/DELETE behavior with optional request bodies.\n      - Improved consistency across all request builders for low-level and high-performance use cases.",
